# Only runtime Go sources, embedded prompt and read-only FAQ assets enter builds.
# In particular, never send .env, Python baseline, Git state, docs or local caches.
**
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!cmd/**
!internal/
!internal/**
!faq/
!faq/**

# Tests and their Python-generated reference payloads are not Go runtime inputs.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
**/testdata/**
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
faq/images/README.md

# Defense in depth for accidentally nested local credentials.
**/.env
**/.env.*
